#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:35
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s expédition demeure encore en route. Son histoire appartient à "
"l’épilogue ; elle ne changera plus l’issue de votre règne."
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)s expéditions demeurent encore en route. Leur histoire appartient à "
"l’épilogue ; elle ne changera plus l’issue de votre règne."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(count)s expedition remains on the road. Its story belongs to the epilogue;"
" it will no longer change the outcome of your reign."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(count)s expeditions remain on the road. Their story belongs to the "
"epilogue; they will no longer change the outcome of your reign."

#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:40
msgid ""
"Monseigneur, aucune cité ne reconnaît plus votre autorité. Je continuerai "
"pourtant de tenir ce livre jusqu’à la fin du règne."
msgstr ""
"My lord, no city recognises your authority any longer. Yet I will keep this "
"book until the end of the reign."

#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:44
msgid ""
"Nous avons suspendu le cours des chroniques. Aucun nouveau décret ne sera "
"reçu avant la reprise du calendrier."
msgstr ""
"We have suspended the chronicles. No new decree will be accepted until the "
"calendar resumes."

#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:48
msgid "Les nouvelles de votre domaine"
msgstr "News of your domain"

#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:49
#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:189
