#: simulation/templates/simulation/letter_entries.html:8
msgid "Monseigneur,"
msgstr "My lord,"

#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:52
msgid ""
"J’ouvre ce livre au premier jour de votre règne. Vos décisions y laisseront "
"leur trace ; j’y consignerai les travaux achevés, les hommes qui reviennent "
"et les cités qui changent de maître."
msgstr ""
"I open this book on the first day of your reign. Your decisions will leave "
"their mark; I will record completed works, returning people and cities that "
"change hands."

#: simulation/templates/simulation/chronicle.html:56
msgid ""
"Voici ce que je peux vous dire de nos terres au terme du mois écoulé. Ces "
"comptes sont ceux de votre maison ; au-delà de ses frontières, nos "
"connaissances demeurent incertaines."
msgstr ""
"Here is what I can tell you of our lands at the end of the past month. These"
" accounts belong to your house; beyond its borders, our knowledge remains "
"uncertain."

